   "link": "[[Run the final evaluation]]",
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "map": "card",
    "id": "t9",
    "kind": "open",
    "color": "3",
    "md": "## 1 · [[Run the final evaluation]]\nOne card, checklist inside: drift fixes (ambiguity labels, memory notes v3, strict + lenient judge, citations) → free metrics (retrieval, agent effort, stage timing, refusals) → own RAGAS judge → off-topic set + refusal verdict → `ragas` sample → paid runs.\n**Done when:** both systems judged on the 500 + off-topic set, 2–3 repeats, report written."
   }
  },
